+## [7.0.1] - unreleased
+
+## Fix
+
+- Fix a panic when working with extreme paddings, where `(padding.left + padding.right) > u16::MAX`.
+- Fix a panic when working with extremely long content, where `(content_width + padding) > u16::MAX`.
+
